{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17423","headline":"赠魏国宪穆公主挽歌词二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"赠魏国宪穆公主挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉制荣车服，周诗美肃雍。\n礼尊同姓主，恩锡大名封。\n外馆留图史，阴堂闭德容。\n睿词悲薤露，千古仰芳踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}